    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the horror and survive the night in IORETIN, a survival horror game inspired by PlayStation 2 classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In IORETIN, you take on the role of a young fisherman who finds himself in a desperate situation. When a thick fog blankets the bay, reducing visibility to almost zero, your brother becomes trapped at sea. But he is not alone; abyssal monsters begin to emerge from the depths and attack the locals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is clear: save your brother and face the horrors lurking in the shadows. Explore detailed environments inspired by a real city in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil, as you fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use melee weapons to combat the monsters and uncover hidden secrets as you progress through the game. The journey begins in a bar near the beach, where true terror reveals itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face your fears and save your brother?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Setting:</strong> Environments inspired by a real city in Rio de Janeiro, providing a unique immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Combat:</strong> Use melee weapons to fight terrifying monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Story:</strong> A thrilling plot that mixes mystery and horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Survival Horror:</strong> Atmosphere and gameplay inspired by the great PlayStation 2 classics.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the horror and survive the night in IORETIN, a survival horror game inspired by PlayStation 2 classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In IORETIN, you take on the role of a young fisherman who finds himself in a desperate situation. When a thick fog blankets the bay, reducing visibility to almost zero, your brother becomes trapped at sea. But he is not alone; abyssal monsters begin to emerge from the depths and attack the locals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is clear: save your brother and face the horrors lurking in the shadows. Explore detailed environments inspired by a real city in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil, as you fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use melee weapons to combat the monsters and uncover hidden secrets as you progress through the game. The journey begins in a bar near the beach, where true terror reveals itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face your fears and save your brother?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Setting:</strong> Environments inspired by a real city in Rio de Janeiro, providing a unique immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Combat:</strong> Use melee weapons to fight terrifying monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Story:</strong> A thrilling plot that mixes mystery and horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Survival Horror:</strong> Atmosphere and gameplay inspired by the great PlayStation 2 classics.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "IORETIN is a survival horror game inspired by PS2 classics. You are a young fisherman who must save your brother trapped at sea while facing abyssal monsters. Explore a city inspired by a real one and fight for survival using melee weapons.",
